      "alt": "LBoxLS1028A board",
      "text": "<h1>Powered by the Layerscape LS1028A processor for a cost-effective and small solution platform</h1>\n<p>The LBoxLS1028A is an embedded BoxPC designed as a cost-effective and compact solution platform, featuring a high-speed 4-port TSN Gigabit Ethernet switch to meet real-time requirements. It is powered by the Layerscape LS1028A processor, its features include graphics with 3D GPU and 4K support, an extended temperature range, low power consumption, and safety functions. With extensive memory options, including DDR4-SDRAM and eMMC, this BoxPC offers flexibility and high-performance capabilities. It also includes multiple communication interfaces such as Ethernet, USB, CAN, and SATA, making it suitable for a wide range of applications. The modular design of the LBoxLS1028A allows engineers to integrate and develop custom hardware solutions, making it a versatile choice for embedded computing projects.</p>",
      "displayPopupTitle": "true",
      "linkTarget": "_self",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Tue Sep 01 2026 10:38:02 GMT+0000",
